    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90996" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτό-λεια</span></b> , τά, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεία</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>first spoils</i> in war, and, generally,
			<i>firstfruits</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				298
			</span></i>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτέλεια</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				4.8.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. τῶν ἐμαυτοῦ σώστρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					184
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν σῶν δὲ γονάτων πρωτόλεια
				θιγγάνω</span>, <i>as the first act</i> of my
			supplication, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				382
			</span></i>: sg.,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρχή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>:—as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πρωτόλειον στέφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1228
				</span></i>
			.</div>
